Depends: ${misc:Depends}, libgtk-3-0, libblkid1, liblzma5, libsecret-1-0, libsqlite3-0
Recommends: steam
Description: Native GNOME Proton compatibility tool manager
 ProtoGNOME is a native GNOME application for managing Proton
 compatibility tools for Steam on Linux.
 .
 It installs and removes GE-Proton (Steam and Heroic) and Luxtorpeda
 (Steam), verifying every download against its published checksum and
 GitHub's recorded SHA-256 digest; releases that can't be verified are
 refused. It also lists the compatibility tool each Steam game uses
 (read-only). Unlike ProtonUp-Qt, it has no KDE/Qt dependencies and
 uses Flutter for a native GNOME look and feel.
